To adjust BGP path prioritization on your Nokia 7750 SR to favor routes from specific providers, configure the administrative distance (`preference`) for peer groups or neighbors. Lower values prioritize routes. For example, to prioritize group `PROVIDER_A` over `PROVIDER_B`:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group "PROVIDER_A"
        preference 100
    exit
    group "PROVIDER_B"
        preference 200
    exit
exit
```

