To configure how the router resolves next-hops for unused private IPv4 and IPv6 routes, apply the following CLI commands. This sets a filter to use specific tunnel types (LDP and RSVP in this example) for both unlabeled and labeled routes:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunn
