                        resolution filter
                        resolution-filter ldp rsvp
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

### Key Details:
1. **`resolution filter`**  
   Restricts next-hop resolution to only the tunnel types explicitly allowed in `resolution-filter`.

