2. Update `rsvp` in `resolution-filter` to match your tunnel type (e.g., `sr-policy`, `ldp`).  
3. Ensure your LSPs are configured with the required admin tag via MPLS/TE configuration.  

This configuration forces BGP to use *only* tagged LSPs of the specified type for next-hop resolution, blocking unlabeled fallback.
