To configure your Nokia 7750 SR for sharing up to 8 IPv6 paths per destination while ignoring incoming path details, use the BGP `add-paths` configuration for unlabeled IPv6 routes. Apply the following CLI commands at the appropriate BGP context (global, group, or neighbor level):

