configure router bgp group "<group-name>" neighbor "<neighbor-ipv6_address>"
    graceful-restart
        restart-time 600
        long-lived
        enable-notification
    exit
exit
```

### Key Actions:
1. **`graceful-restart`**: Enables helper mode to preserve IPv6 routes and maintain the session during the neighbor's restart.
2. **`restart-time 600`**: Extends the route retention period to 600 seconds (10 minutes), giving the neighbor more time to recover.
3. **`long-lived`**: Activates LLGR to retain stale routes even if the neighbor takes longer than `restart-time` to reconnect.
4. **`enable-notification`**: Ensures sessions stay up during unexpected errors (e.g., NOTIFICATION messages).

