To configure TCP keepalive probes to every half-minute (30 seconds) and adjust for unstable links:

```
configure
    bmp
        station <station-name>
            connection
                tcp-keepalive
                    keep-interval 30
                    keep-count 6
                exit
            exit
        exit
```

**Key changes made:**  
- `keep-interval 30` reduces probe frequency to every 30 seconds  
- `keep-count 6` increases tolerance to 3 minutes of missed probes (6 × 30 seconds) before declaring the connection down, giving unstable links more recovery time  

**Defaults maintained:**  
- `keep-idle 600` (probes start after 10 minutes of idle time) remains unchanged to avoid premature checks  

Replace `<station-name>` with your BMP station identifier.
