To address the issue of "frag needed" ICMP messages during TCP flows, enable path MTU discovery for BGP sessions to allow automatic adjustment of packet sizes. Use the following CLI command:

```cli
configure router bgp path-mtu-discovery
```

This configuration sets the DF bit in packets and dynamically adapts the MTU based on ICMP feedback, eliminating the need for manual adjustments.
