To configure BGP Long-Lived Graceful Restart (LLGR) for specific non-forwarding services like L2-VPN and flow-IP while excluding regular IPv4/IPv6 unicast, use the following CLI commands. Apply this configuration under the appropriate BGP context (global, group, or neighbor) based on your setup:

